DAFoam case template for the drag cube (optimization.forward_solver: "dafoam").

Patch names follow the sdf_hex drag default: inlet (x_min), outlet (x_max), sides (the four
remaining domain faces, slip) and dragObject (the wall, group dragObjectGroup). The mesh is
written per iteration by the pipeline; the DAFoam settings come from the optimization.dafoam
block of the config. See ../../experiments/optimization/cylinder/dafoam_notes.md in the
Pultrusion repo for the background and the pitfalls.
